   "text": "Miami has grown tremendously over the last 30 years. We’re a different city than we were 30 years ago. I truly believe that if it weren’t for Americans for Immigrant Justice and the support that we’ve given to so many vulnerable communities Miami would look very different. The brilliance, the success, the transformation of our city would look very different if it weren’t for Americans for Immigrant Justice really fulfilling the need in the community.",
